      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "d7ed98e56eab06abba64d86549a0f7bbaa852599764ecec039c4b143f226b82f:000002_763421303366267352:g0:r8",
      "row_index_0based": 8,
      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "僕はちょっとした用事で、ピペリさんの宇宙船にやってきた――、\nのだが、ヴォミラさんも付いてきていた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
